<div class="h2bg"><div><h2 id="cms6574A">市役所第二庁舎各階案内</h2></div></div>


<div class="wysiwyg_wp"><p><strong class="text-color-yellow"><span class="text-color-yellow">8階</span></strong><br>会議室等<br><strong class="text-color-yellow"><span class="text-color-yellow">7階</span></strong><br><a href="/shisei/kakuka/kyouikubu/syomuka/index.html" class="innerLink">庶務課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/kyouikubu/gakumuka/index.html" class="innerLink">学務課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/kyouikubu/shidoushitsu/index.html" class="innerLink">指導室</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/shogaigakushubu/syougaigakusyuuka/index.html" class="innerLink">生涯学習課</a><br><strong class="text-color-yellow"><span class="text-color-yellow">6階</span></strong><br><a href="/shisei/kakuka/kikakuzaiseibu/jyouhoushisutemuka/index.html" class="innerLink">情報システム課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/soumubu/soumuka/index.html" class="innerLink">総務課（情報公開係）</a>、情報公開コーナー、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/senkyokanriiinkaijimukyoku/senkyokanriiinkaijimukyoku/index.html" class="innerLink">選挙管理委員会事務局</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/kansaiinjimukyoku/kansaiinjimukyoku/index.html" class="innerLink">監査委員事務局</a><br><strong class="text-color-yellow"><span class="text-color-yellow">5階</span></strong><br><a href="/shisei/kakuka/toshikensetsubu/keikakuka/index.html" class="innerLink">都市計画課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/toshikensetsubu/kaihatsusidoutantou/index.html" class="innerLink">まちづくり推進課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/toshikensetsubu/dourokanrika/index.html" class="innerLink">道路管理課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/toshikensetsubu/kensetsuka/index.html" class="innerLink">建築営繕課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/toshikensetsubu/kotutaisakuka/index.html" class="innerLink">交通対策課</a><br><strong class="text-color-yellow"><span class="text-color-yellow">4階</span></strong><br><a href="/shisei/kakuka/kankyoubu/kankyouseisakuka/index.html" class="innerLink">環境政策課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/kankyoubu/gomitaisakuka/index.html" class="innerLink">ごみ対策課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/kankyoubu/gesuidouka/index.html" class="innerLink">下水道課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/kodomokateibu/jidouseisyounenka/index.html" class="innerLink">児童青少年課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/shiminbu/keizaika/index.html" class="innerLink">経済課</a>、消費生活相談室、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/shiminbu/shiminbunkaka/index.html" class="innerLink">コミュニティ文化課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/nougyouiinkaijimukyoku/nougyouiinkaijimukyoku/index.html" class="innerLink">農業委員会事務局</a><br><strong class="text-color-yellow"><span class="text-color-yellow">3階</span></strong><br><a href="/shisei/kakuka/shiminbu/shiminzeika/index.html" class="innerLink">市民税課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/shiminbu/shisanzeika/index.html" class="innerLink">資産税課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/shiminbu/nouzeika/index.html" class="innerLink">納税課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/kodomokateibu/kosodateshienka/index.html" class="innerLink">子育て支援課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/kodomokateibu/hoikuka/index.html" class="innerLink">保育課</a><br><strong class="text-color-yellow"><span class="text-color-yellow">2階</span></strong><br><a href="/shisei/kakuka/shiminbu/hokennenkinka/index.html" class="innerLink">保険年金課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/fukushihokenbu/fukushisuishinka/index.html" class="innerLink">地域福祉課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/fukushihokenbu/jiritsuseikatsushien/index.html" class="innerLink">自立生活支援課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/fukushihokenbu/kaigofukushika/index.html" class="innerLink">介護福祉課</a><br><strong class="text-color-yellow"><span class="text-color-yellow">1階</span></strong><br><a href="/shisei/kakuka/kikakuzaiseibu/kouhoukouchouka/index.html" class="innerLink">広報秘書課（広聴係）</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/shiminbu/shiminka/index.html" class="innerLink">市民課</a>、<a href="/shisei/kakuka/syuunyuuyakushitsu/kaikeika/index.html" class="innerLink">会計課</a>、障害者就労センター、市民相談室</p></div>











    
    
